### Signed webhook
# Never put WEBHOOK_SECRET in this tracked file.
#
# With the API running, send a real signed request from the repository root:
#
# node apps/api/scripts/send-webhook.mjs \
#   <organization-id> \
#   <required-skill-id> \
#   [external-request-id] \
#   [external-event-id]
#
# Re-run the exact same command with explicit IDs to observe
# the 200 duplicate-success behavior.